 261: ### A constraint the design must survive â€” found by reading, not by failing
 262: 
 263: `tests/at/harness/runner-blackbox.selftest.ts:63-69` and `runner-expect.selftest.ts:57-59` **generate
 264: synthetic suites at run time** into a disposable tree, whose shared preamble calls
